{"ticker":"SHOP","updated":"2026-11-07T01:52:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Shopify Inc.","shortName":"Shopify Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"Canada","website":"https://www.shopify.com","fullTimeEmployees":7600,"marketCap":191575998464,"trailingPE":91.35583,"forwardPE":60.68572,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":13.522694,"pegRatio":2.01,"targetMeanPrice":176.74286,"targetHighPrice":220.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":49,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.316,"earningsGrowth":0.795,"grossMargins":0.47491002,"operatingMargins":0.18386,"profitMargins":0.15007,"totalRevenue":14167000064,"beta":2.664,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":180.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":94.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Shopify Inc., a commerce technology company, provides tools to start, scale, market, and run a business of various sizes in Canada, the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. The Company offers Shopify platform that enables merchants to manage products and inventory, process orders and payments, fulfill and ship orders, build customer relationships, source products, leverage analytics, and reporting and access financing for running their business across all of their sales channels, including web and mobile storefronts, physical retail locations, social media storefronts, and marketplaces. It also provides Shopify Payments, a fully integrated payment processing service that allows merchants to accept and process payment cards online and offline. In addition, the company engages in the sale of themes and apps; shipping labels through Shopify Shipping; point-of-sale hardware; advertising on the Shopify App Store; and Shop Campaigns for buyer acquisitions, as well as registration of domain names. The company was formerly known as Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc. and changed its name to Shopify Inc. in November 2011. Shopify Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Ottawa, Canada.","summary_zh":"Shopify Inc. 是一家商業科技公司，為加拿大、美國、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和拉丁美洲的各種規模的企業提供啟動、擴展、行銷和營運的工具。該公司提供的 Shopify 平台使商家能夠管理產品和庫存、處理訂單和付款、履行和發貨訂單、建立客戶關係、採購產品、利用分析以及報告和獲取融資，以便在所有銷售管道（包括網路和行動店面、實體零售店、社交媒體店面和市場）經營業務。它還提供 Shopify Payments，這是一種完全整合的支付處理服務，可讓商家在線上和線下接受和處理支付卡。此外，該公司還從事主題和應用程式的銷售；透過 Shopify Shipping 運輸標籤；銷售點硬體； Shopify 應用程式商店上的廣告；用於購買買家的商店活動以及網域註冊。該公司前身為 Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc.，並於 2011 年 11 月更名為 Shopify Inc.。 Shopify Inc. 成立於 2004 年，總部位於加拿大渥太華。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":147.56,"h":148.57,"l":144.078,"c":146.22,"v":5782100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":145.025,"h":146.61,"l":142.85,"c":143.44,"v":5748600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":144.55,"h":145.46,"l":141.3,"c":142.2,"v":7362100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":142.05,"h":146.99,"l":142.05,"c":145.03,"v":6051900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":143.52,"h":144.62,"l":141.52,"c":143.38,"v":4911600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":144.24,"h":148.2,"l":142.89,"c":147.89,"v":6714600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":149.09,"h":150.17,"l":145.2,"c":147.21,"v":5453800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":148.47,"h":149.1,"l":145.37,"c":147.87,"v":4291200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":149.5,"h":152.93,"l":148.19,"c":152.11,"v":6485800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":151.96,"h":155.13,"l":151.75,"c":153.3,"v":8812900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":153.18,"h":159.01,"l":151.81,"c":157.12,"v":7020700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":157.1,"h":157.19,"l":149.1,"c":149.94,"v":7376000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":150.79,"h":152.31,"l":148.28,"c":148.83,"v":5559500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":145.0,"h":145.14,"l":142.09,"c":143.45,"v":8511200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":143.12,"h":144.0,"l":139.5,"c":140.25,"v":7259500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":141.75,"h":149.58,"l":140.91,"c":149.0,"v":14702700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":147.99,"h":151.78,"l":145.47,"c":148.61,"v":9254600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":146.28,"h":151.744,"l":146.1,"c":149.57,"v":6733300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":151.25,"h":151.47,"l":147.855,"c":151.3,"v":7272300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":152.88,